.TH "cherrycherrysquarewave-by-funnycurlycatcodefactory" "6" "2026-11-13" "Cherry Cherry Square Wave User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
cherrycherrysquarewave-by-funnycurlycatcodefactory - run the Cherry
Cherry Square Wave 4k intro
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]cherrycherrysquarewave-by-funnycurlycatcodefactory\f[R]
[\f[B]--help\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cherry Cherry Square Wave is a Linux 4k intro released by Funny Curly
Cat Code Factory (FCCCF) in March 2019.
It ranked 4th in the combined intro compo at Instanssi 2019.
.PP
muffintrap [code]
.PP
The intro opens an SDL 1.2 window and draws flowers with OpenGL, on a
raw square wave soundtrack.
Tools used: Lubuntu 18.04, Spacemacs, Clang and zopfli.
.PP
Upstream ships an original version, whose audio is very clippy and
distorted, and a \[lq]fixed audio\[rq] version.
This package installs the fixed audio version only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]--help\f[R]
display a short usage message and exit.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=80567
.SH BUGS
.PP
Since Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 13, SDL 1.2 is provided by sdl12-compat
(on top of SDL 2).
.SH AUTHORS
Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>,Claude Opus 5.5,Funny Curly Cat
Code Factory.
